block description
  p The teamwork platform for the AI era — Atlassian’s apps, agents, and platform bring together an organization’s knowledge and AI-led workflows to unleash the potential of every team.
  p I work on the Teamwork Graph, Atlassian’s intelligent data layer that powers teamwork context, cross-platform experiences, and Rovo AI.
  span.tag 2025 &ndash; Current
  hr
  a.button(href="https://teamworkgraph.com/") Teamwork Graph
    span.rarr

